rfc8410.txt
    RFC 8410, "Algorithm Identifiers for Ed25519, Ed448, X25519, and X448 for Use in the Internet X.509 Public Key
    Infrastructure", https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8410.txt, downloaded on 2026-10-26.
    License: IETF Trust Legal Provisions; the examples are data.
    Format: the text of the RFC; the tests read the PEM blocks of section 10 (the Ed25519 public key, the X25519
    certificate and the Ed25519 private keys) and the key value printed after the first private key.
    Used: every example of section 10.

rfc9881.txt
    RFC 9881, "Internet X.509 Public Key Infrastructure: Algorithm Identifiers for ML-DSA",
    https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9881.txt, downloaded on 2026-10-26.
    License: IETF Trust Legal Provisions; the examples are data.
    Format: the text of the RFC; the tests read the PEM blocks of appendix C with the heading they follow: the
    private keys of C.1 (seed, expanded and both, for ML-DSA-44, -65 and -87), the public keys of C.2, the
    certificates of C.3 and the inconsistent private keys of C.4, which must be rejected.
    Used: every example.

rfc9909.txt
